# Memory

Constitution, clearance, and model policy change only by explicit user decision.

Project memory lives only under that project's `.cursor/ai-dev-team/`. Do not write another project there. Do not fill core with one project's findings.

A proposal to improve a skill, rule, or model route goes to `.cursor/ai-dev-team/proposals/` and is not applied by itself.

Do not dump the whole chat context to disk.
